senses.gloss:
--a son of रजतनाभ, (भद्रा-वा। प्।) married पुण्यजनी who was the mother of a number of यक्षस्;
1: Br. III. 7. १२०; वा. ६९. १५२, १५७.
the commander of the army of the यक्षस् living in चन्द्रप्रभा; lived on the hill adjoining Caitraratha;
2: Br. II. १८. 7-8; M. १२१. 8-9.
devoted to ललिता;
3: Br. IV. ३३. ७८.
यक्ष sena1pati.
4: वा. ४७. 7.

(II)--a place near प्रयागा protected by Hari;
1: M. १०४. 9.
five yojanas in extent;
2: Ib. १०८. 9.
every step there, is equal to an अश्वमेध.
3: Ib. १११. 8.
